Monitor work quality, attendance, discipline, and daily task execution;

Assist with onboarding, task allocation, scheduling, and day-to-day communication with household staff;

Ensure smooth collaboration among all household support personnel;

Help manage leave, rota planning, and backup arrangements when necessary.

