The Marketing Officer is a proactive, organised and professional individual responsible for supporting the efficient and successful management of pupil recruitment initiatives while promoting the ethos and philosophy of Malvern College Hong Kong. The incumbent will assist the Marketing Manager and Communications Manager in delivering effective services within the Marketing Team, ensuring alignment with the Malvern’s strategic goals.

