Convey enthusiasm with sincerity and consistency, with a proven track record of success in meeting targets, and be a highly motivated individual;

Strong interpersonal and communication skills, with the ability to work both independently and as part of a team;

An organised individual with excellent time management skills to effectively juggle multiple tasks and priorities;

Understanding and experience with Adobe Suite software is desirable – i.e. Photoshop, Illustrator, etc.

Proficient in Canva and MS Office;

Knowledge of Google Analytics and SEO is advantageous;

Excellent customer service skills;

A desire to work in a fast-paced environment with the ability to multitask;

Good IT and administrative skills, with the ability to accurately utilise a large database.

